flowchart LR
  user[User browser]
  spa[Vercel React SPA]
  edge[Cloudflare API edge]
  api[Render Django API]
  db[(PostgreSQL vendor unverified)]
  cache[(Redis optional; live not configured)]
  market[Market APIs: Finnhub, Alpha Vantage, RapidAPI, Twelve Data, Yahoo]
  hf[Hugging Face Hub: model downloads]
  email[SendGrid API / Brevo SMTP / console]
  sentry[Sentry]
  ga[Google Analytics 4]
  va[Vercel Analytics]
  gh[GitHub Actions]
  s3[AWS S3 backup script only]

  user -->|HTTPS GET/POST| spa
  user -->|HTTPS JSON; JWT or API key| edge
  edge -->|HTTPS origin proxy| api
  api -->|PostgreSQL TLS via DATABASE_URL| db
  api -.->|Redis protocol if REDIS_URL set| cache
  api -->|HTTPS; server-side provider credentials| market
  api -->|HTTPS model/tokenizer download| hf
  api -->|HTTPS API or SMTP STARTTLS| email
  api -->|HTTPS error events| sentry
  spa -->|HTTPS events after consent| ga
  spa -->|HTTPS telemetry; component always mounted| va
  gh -->|HTTPS deployment API| api
  gh -->|HTTPS deployment API| spa
  api -.->|Manual script only; not scheduled| s3

  %% No payment processor, LLM inference API, OAuth provider or webhook receiver found in the audited repository.
